{ This is how we are going to launch our pieces. Rook in a semi-open file,bishop on a long diagonal , knights having a strong control on the centre. } { [%csl Gc8,Gg4,Ge4,Gd4,Gb4][%cal Gc8c1,Gg7a1,Gc6d4,Gc6b4,Gf6e4,Gf6g4] } *


[Event "THE SICILIAN DRAGON: LAUNCHING THE PIECES"]
[Date "2021.08.08"]
[Result "*"]
[Variant "Standard"]
[ECO "B78"]
[Opening "Sicilian Defense: Dragon Variation, Yugoslav Attack, Old Line"]
[StudyName "THE SICILIAN DRAGON"]
[ChapterName "LAUNCHING THE PIECES"]
