1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 { Knight to c6 } { [%csl Gc6][%cal Gb8c6] } 2... Nc6 3. d4 { Cxd4 } 3... cxd4 4. Nxd4 { play g6 now } 4... g6 { This is the move for accelerated dragon. } { [%csl Gg6] } 5. Nc3 { Bishop to? } { [%csl Gg7][%cal Gf8g7] } 5... Bg7 { Now you continue the development as taught before! } *


