{ Yes faster than previous one!! } 1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 { g6 now } { [%csl Gg6][%cal Gg7g6] } 2... g6 { the hyperaccelerated dragon } 3. d4 { capture } { [%csl Gd4][%cal Gc5d4] } 3... cxd4 4. Nxd4 { Bg7 } { [%csl Gg7][%cal Gf8g7] } 4... Bg7 5. c4 { Nf6 } { [%csl Gf6][%cal Gg8f6] } 5... Nf6 { Two pieces developed rapidly and castling on king side saves the king from major threats! } { [%csl Gg7,Gf6][%cal Ge8g8] } *


